  "project_description": "The Page Hits module is used for displaying page statistics.\n\n INSTALLATION\n\n------------\n\n * Install the Page Hits module as you would normally install a contributed\n\n Drupal module. Visit https://www.drupal.org/node/1897420 for further\n\n information.\n\n CONFIGURATION\n\n-------------\n\n 1. Navigate to Administration > Extend and enable the module.\n\n 2. Navigate to Administration > Structure > Block Layout and place a block.\n\n 3. Search for the \"Page Hits\" block and assign it to a page. Save.\n\n 4. Navigate to Administration > Configuration > System > Page Hits for more\n\n configurations.",
